    "估算 1RM (Epley)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estimated 1RM (Epley)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "估算 1RM (Epley)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "估算 1RM = 重量 × (1 + 次数 ÷ 30)，次数上限 30，RIR 会加到次数上。自重动作按体重系数折算等效负重。评分按体重比值在动作标准曲线上插值得到，1–1000。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estimated 1RM = weight × (1 + reps ÷ 30), capped at 30 reps; RIR is added to the reps. Bodyweight exercises are converted to an equivalent load using a bodyweight factor. The score is interpolated on the exercise's standard curve by bodyweight ratio, from 1 to 1000."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "估算 1RM = 重量 × (1 + 次数 ÷ 30)，次数上限 30，RIR 会加到次数上。自重动作按体重系数折算等效负重。评分按体重比值在动作标准曲线上插值得到，1–1000。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "估算 1RM = 重量 × (1 + 次数 ÷ 30)，次数上限 30；填写 RPE 时按剩余次数（RIR）调整；自重动作使用等效负重模型。评分结合体重与男/女曲线，范围 1–1000，对应 Wood 到 Olympian 九个段位。肌群段位由该肌群动作的最佳评分加权得到，总体评分 GSR 中更强的肌群占更高权重。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estimated 1RM = weight × (1 + reps ÷ 30), capped at 30 reps. When RPE is entered, it's adjusted by reps in reserve (RIR); bodyweight exercises use an equivalent-load model. Scores factor in body weight and male/female curves, ranging from 1–1000 across nine tiers from Wood to Olympian. Each muscle group's rank is a weighted result of the best scores from its exercises, and stronger muscle groups carry more weight in the overall score GSR."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "估算 1RM = 重量 × (1 + 次数 ÷ 30)，次数上限 30；填写 RPE 时按剩余次数（RIR）调整；自重动作使用等效负重模型。评分结合体重与男/女曲线，范围 1–1000，对应 Wood 到 Olympian 九个段位。肌群段位由该肌群动作的最佳评分加权得到，总体评分 GSR 中更强的肌群占更高权重。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
