    "减脂为维持热量 −500 kcal，增肌为 +300 kcal。热量较低时会按比例缩放蛋白质与脂肪，为碳水保留至少 20% 热量。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fat loss is maintenance −500 kcal; muscle gain is +300 kcal. At lower calorie targets, protein and fat are scaled down proportionally, keeping at least 20% of calories for carbs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "减脂为维持热量 −500 kcal，增肌为 +300 kcal。热量较低时会按比例缩放蛋白质与脂肪，为碳水保留至少 20% 热量。"
