    "用每日训练赚到的 Eggs 购买小人的发型、衣服、配饰、背景，以及头像框、称号、主题色与段位卡；高段位外观需要达到对应段位。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spend Eggs earned from daily workouts on hairstyles, clothes, accessories and backgrounds for your character, plus avatar frames, titles, accent themes and rank cards. High-rank cosmetics require reaching that rank."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用每日训练赚到的 Eggs 购买小人的发型、衣服、配饰、背景，以及头像框、称号、主题色与段位卡；高段位外观需要达到对应段位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
