    "细分段位由相关动作的最佳记录估算。发布有评分标准的相关训练后，才会显示对应段位。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detailed ranks are estimated from your best records on related exercises. A rank appears only after you publish a workout that includes a rated exercise for that area."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "细分段位由相关动作的最佳记录估算。发布有评分标准的相关训练后，才会显示对应段位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "细分段位由相关动作的最佳记录估算。训练记录未区分左右侧，左右胸暂不单独评分。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detailed ranks are estimated from your best records in related exercises. Workout logs don't distinguish left and right sides, so left and right chest aren't scored separately yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "细分段位由相关动作的最佳记录估算。训练记录未区分左右侧，左右胸暂不单独评分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
